  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">H2H DEMAC Democratic Republic of Congo Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project strengthened collaboration between Congolese diaspora and local actors in North and South Kivu by enhancing fundraising capacities and supporting coordinated emergency relief efforts. It reviewed diaspora-led humanitarian initiatives, facilitated online knowledge-exchange workshops, and delivered joint crowdfunding training to improve collective resource mobilization.</narrative>
  </description>
